            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method for customizing forefoot cushioning of an article of footwear comprising: providing a rating system to a computing system of a customer; receiving a customer-selected rating of a first level of forefoot cushioning of a first sole member of a first article of footwear through the rating system; and transmitting the customer-selected rating of the first level of forefoot cushioning to a server to make the customer-selected rating information accessible by a footwear manufacturer when manufacturing a new article of footwear for the customer.</p>
            </abstract>
